<body>
    <h1>6b. Escalations from Other Teams</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <ul local-id=3D"a7ef0ddd-f576-488d-90b9-d43a4d279918">
<li local-id=3D"5e19cd92-5091-445b-b2b0-b4407d00478d">
<p local-id=3D"87e4683c9e42"><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://doc=
s.google.com/document/d/1Re9Mk5MOcaKkny6JsIAeaoUc8rKkI7697GZ-2232sAM/edit#h=
.ur609ocol6t1" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Internal Escalations to Fraud Support</u=
></a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14e4ea55-eed4-4c5d-8139-54906ddadd3e">
<p local-id=3D"67ae2e950344"><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://doc=
s.google.com/document/d/1Re9Mk5MOcaKkny6JsIAeaoUc8rKkI7697GZ-2232sAM/edit#h=
.iuwmzcqd8596" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Escalations from Customer Support (CS)</=
u></a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1a493677-e5aa-41ee-9e9a-23035b42b672">
<p local-id=3D"df143f00c0fe"><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://doc=
s.google.com/document/d/1Re9Mk5MOcaKkny6JsIAeaoUc8rKkI7697GZ-2232sAM/edit#h=
.aojea92il8k6" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Escalations from Other TA Employees</u><=
/a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5362ecc2-40aa-4c43-9f2e-8d2fcf9cbad3">
<p local-id=3D"aecfe64424e1"><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://doc=
s.google.com/document/d/1Re9Mk5MOcaKkny6JsIAeaoUc8rKkI7697GZ-2232sAM/edit#h=
.4od1gd8gocgp" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Handling Unclear Escalations</u></a></p>=
</li>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"488bf6d936d7" id=3D"id-6b.EscalationsfromOtherTeams-Interna=
lEscalationstoFraudSupport"><strong>Internal Escalations to Fraud Support</=
strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"b21feaed5679">Other teams escalate cases to Fraud Support wh=
en they encounter potential fraud in their requests from owners or users. A=
ll incoming tickets are vetted and fully investigated by a Fraud Support ag=
ent.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"62547c6c2c08" id=3D"id-6b.EscalationsfromOtherTeams-Escalat=
ionsfromCustomerSupport(CS)"><strong>Escalations from Customer Support (CS)=
</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"1e115db604cb">CS escalations arrive as emails from <a class=
=3D"external-link" href=3D"mailto:help@tripadvisorsupport.com" rel=3D"nofol=
low">help@tripadvisorsupport.com</a>.</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<h3 local-id=3D"5e5e1714f8f8" id=3D"id-6b.EscalationsfromOtherTeams-Critica=
lSafetyCheck:Beforeresponding,youmustensureyouarenotreplyingtoCSorleakingin=
ternalnotestotheenduser.Zendeskusuallydoesthisautomatically,butyoumustverif=
y:"><strong>Critical Safety Check:</strong> Before responding, you <strong>=
must</strong> ensure you are not replying to CS or leaking internal notes t=
o the end user. Zendesk usually does this automatically, but you must verif=
y:</h3>
</div>
</div>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"30b04512-1056-487e-8ccf-8af54b65534a">
<li local-id=3D"e6e907b7-3b67-4bdc-9536-525e1ade73d0">
<p local-id=3D"1aa03bae8c09"><strong>Check Requester:</strong> Is the reque=
ster the <strong>owner/user</strong>, not CS?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dc157476-e7ae-47c7-ac06-2c94edb2b63a">
<p local-id=3D"3966acf2d746"><strong>Check Note Type:</strong> Is the CS me=
ssage an <strong>Internal Note</strong>?</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"f27905b7dc06" id=3D"id-6b.EscalationsfromOtherTeams-Howtofi=
xmanuallyifZendeskfails:"><strong>How to fix manually if Zendesk fails:</st=
rong></h4>
<ul local-id=3D"af49e9d8-fcbc-4b66-8f95-e41f475362c4">
<li local-id=3D"b3005a9a-88d1-41d8-a182-a07dcdb428b2">
<p local-id=3D"24594ab96a3a"><strong>Convert Note:</strong> Click on <stron=
g>Events</strong> &gt; <strong>"Make this comment an internal note"</strong=
> &gt; <strong>Confirm</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"74d9f9cb-06cb-4561-afb7-37d6a2404762">
<p local-id=3D"95307daa672e"><strong>Change Requester:</strong> Copy the ow=
ner=E2=80=99s email address from the ticket body and paste it in the reques=
ter=E2=80=99s box on the top right side..</p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper con=
fluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confl=
