<hr local-id=3D"eda45ef9edd7">
<h2 local-id=3D"6bc87a30d44a" id=3D"id-6b.EscalationsfromOtherTeams-Escalat=
ionsfromOtherTAEmployees"><strong>Escalations from Other TA Employees</stro=
ng></h2>
<p local-id=3D"2bde036108ff">When a TA employee emails us directly about a =
property:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"d50864a9-2dd3-4831-acf2-b2489e7597e7">
<li local-id=3D"ca28fe9a-22d5-4124-962a-55b41aa14691">
<p local-id=3D"6814274b1f7a"><strong>Acknowledge:</strong> Reply to the emp=
loyee thanking them. State that we will continue the conversation with the =
owner directly. (Do not provide further case details).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"28697ba5-96e8-421a-b243-bcd9c3345c18">
<p local-id=3D"80e9cfa7ee05"><strong>Search:</strong> Check Zendesk for exi=
sting conversations with that owner.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"09d36b51-adaf-4770-b4bc-cccc16a724a9">
<p local-id=3D"b3171c650032"><strong>New Ticket:</strong> If no existing th=
read exists, create a new ticket to the owner.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e04b977-0a80-4ce6-b1bc-8c8c5469eff3">
<p local-id=3D"1272e0514f11"><strong>Document:</strong> Quote the original =
employee inquiry in your <strong>Internal Notes</strong>.</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"9fc230194daa">Sometimes colleagues from other departments re=
gister as Owners to help their customer, if a registered/verified owner is =
using the @tripadvisor.com domain, please <strong>do not </strong>reply to =
them but to the actual owner.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"8a1915789680">When analysts in the <strong>User Review Dashb=
oard (URD)</strong> use the <strong>"Escalate to SF"</strong> button on the=
 right, one of the following Zendesk tickets is created:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"7=
e8fbccc-59f8-41ae-81c7-0c826d9cb4f1" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"366a39d4-b34b-46c5-ac9e-d04e5a362f58">
<td data-local-id=3D"bd9c8c93-9726-4499-ba1c-4807071f3faf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d3b2c995ecc7"><strong>ZD Ticket Subject</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e83a017f-4b9a-4e47-aef4-1d1bab40a47f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"38851e017a15"><strong>Drop Down selected</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e240c102-f426-487d-b18d-af3d2368cc7d">
<td data-local-id=3D"7bd91a33-6c3a-4a43-a9ab-3a3d3073bdce" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"570a8a67763a"><strong>Potential CI Investigation Lead</stron=
g></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b6b1c5d5-1abd-4c64-98db-d2b9d81fa149" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c02381459b14">Create Investigation Case</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"95531db4-555c-4b13-9a19-64b7efed0cd8">
<td data-local-id=3D"980f364b-5d48-4bd5-9524-625d74ea6aa0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"47a6310ad918"><strong>General Escalation</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"34305504-dd12-4ca0-8561-6090b514b9d4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a16b3e116fe3">Fraud =E2=80=93 Escalated Review</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f8bf12e7-efb7-4ee4-8b50-faa2df3986cf">
<td data-local-id=3D"859fc238-0701-40a4-bde0-693a09707bc2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aeca2f835a9a"><strong>Fraud Escalation =E2=80=93 Red Badge R=
ecommendation</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"347bb78b-bc9b-41ce-a520-225ec212b433" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"df8ead2bd189">For the Investigations Team</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper co=
