<hr local-id=3D"cb31e393-ee17-4e11-8931-1d4f09c8debb">
<h2 local-id=3D"750656d8960c" id=3D"id-6b.EscalationsfromOtherTeams-Handlin=
gUnclearEscalations"><strong>Handling Unclear Escalations</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"5307a2479840">If a ticket is ambiguous or lacks sufficient i=
nformation, follow these escalation paths to help improve inter-team qualit=
y:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"100b2a1f-11b7-4ad7-9571-598589d5f006">
<li local-id=3D"53d375a7-cdff-41da-86a0-79d50a385778">
<p local-id=3D"3385b0ab8e72"><strong>Unclear CS Tickets:</strong> Escalate =
to <strong>Tier 2</strong>. We will follow up with the CS team to improve t=
heir commenting quality.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f73e66fbd7b0"></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
